      "exp_en": "B is correct: the Clean Needle Technique (or sterile needle technique) was established to reduce the risk of Hepatitis B transmission in the clinical setting of acupuncture. It addresses two main sources of infectious agents: autogenous infections (self-produced, e.g., moving a needle from one body area to another) and cross-infections (transferred from another person or the environment).",
      "exp_hant": "B 正確：潔針技術（或稱無菌針技術）的建立是為了降低針灸臨床環境中B型肝炎傳播的風險。它針對兩大感染原來源：自體感染（自身產生，例如將針從身體某部位移到另一部位）與交叉感染（從他人或環境傳入）。"
