      "exp_en": "C is correct: the guiding principle is that information be communicated in an effective, understandable way to ensure patient safety. Chinese characters (traditional or simplified) or the Latinate medicinal name give the most unambiguous names. The botanical/Latinate medicinal name is required but may not be sufficient alone, so the Chinese characters or Pinyin should always be provided along with it. Pinyin should not be used alone since it can cause confusion, especially where multiple species share the same Chinese name.",
      "exp_hant": "C 正確：指導原則是資訊必須以有效、易懂的方式傳達，以確保病人安全。中文字（正體或簡體）或拉丁藥名提供最無歧義的名稱。植物學名/拉丁藥名是必要的，但單獨可能不足，因此應始終同時附上中文字或拼音。拼音不應單獨使用，因為可能造成混淆，尤其當多個物種共用同一中文名時。"
    },
