      "exp_en": "C is correct: when an herb or formula is unavailable, or the dispenser is unsure of the prescription, they should obtain advice from the prescribing practitioner before dispensing. The need to contact may be waived only if the difference has no significant therapeutic implications (requiring expert knowledge of comparable effects), or if a same-name, same-composition formula can be substituted from a different manufacturer — done with care, advising the patient and practitioner. If in any doubt, the dispenser must consult the practitioner; patient safety guides the decision.",
      "exp_hant": "C 正確：當藥材或方劑缺貨，或調劑者對處方有疑問時，應在調配前向開方執業者取得建議。只有在差異無顯著治療影響（需具備對等效果的專業知識），或可用同名、同組成但不同製造商的方劑替代（須謹慎進行並告知病人與執業者）時，才可免於聯繫。若有任何疑慮，調劑者必須諮詢執業者；病人安全是決策的準則。"
    },
    {
